[Id "lasker-bauer"]
[Name "Lasker's double bishop sacrifice"]
[White "Emanuel Lasker"]
[Black "Johann Bauer"]
[Event "Amsterdam"]
[Date "1889"]
[Result "1-0"]
[Source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lasker_versus_Bauer,_Amsterdam,_1889"]
[Blurb "Lasker gives up both bishops, on h7 and g7, to strip Black's king of its pawns, then a rook lift wins the queen. The pattern has turned up in master games ever since, from Nimzowitsch against Tarrasch in 1914 to Polgar against Karpov in 2003."]

